    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91813" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρο-φόρος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>) in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inflammatory missiles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				91.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				94.8
			</span></i>; <i>engines</i> which discharge such missiles, ib.<i><span class="en">
				95.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> sg.,
				<i>bearer of sacrificial fire</i>, at Epidaurus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).400
			</span></i>, al.; at Argos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				735.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουροφόρος,
				πυρωφώρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).997
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1021
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Laconia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρφόρος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.2b
			</span></i> (q.v.).</div>
